<title>UK: BZW SETS CALL WARRANTS ON BANK OF IRELAND.</title>
<headline>BZW SETS CALL WARRANTS ON BANK OF IRELAND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued 20 million European-style call warrants on shares of Bank of Ireland, lead manager BZW Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    8.4 IEP		   ISSUE PRICE  1.14 IEP</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   12.FEB.99		 PAYDATE	02.SEP.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  8.4 IEP  NOTES	     PRICES QUOTED ON REUTER PAGE  BZFA</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
